SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers only the original explainer code and text in this
repository (engine/, tools/, assets/, sites/, prompts/, docs/, skill/ and the
top-level files). It does NOT cover:

  * projects/openai-math/ — an unmodified copy of Lean source files from
    https://github.com/openai/math (commit adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a),
    copyright OpenAI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See
    projects/openai-math/LICENSE and projects/openai-math/VENDORED.md. Those
    files, and every reproduction of them on the published site (the
    highlighted source pages and the Lean statements shown on node pages),
    remain under the Apache License 2.0.
  * Third-party libraries loaded by the site at run time (cytoscape, dagre,
    marked, js-yaml, ajv, giscus), which keep their own licenses.
